[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あのお話……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That story...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あの本の元のお話は、とても悲しいものでした）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The original story behind that book was such a sad one.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（お城で一人ぼっちだったお姫様は、お姫様を嫌う\n\u3000義姉の噂を信じた村の人たちからも見放されて）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The princess, all alone in the castle, was abandoned even by the villagers who believed the rumors spread by her step-sister who hated her.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（やっと騎士に助け出されても、\n\u3000村で二人ぼっちになってしまったのでした）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even after the knight finally rescued her, they ended up all alone together in the village.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それでも、お姫様は寂しくなかったんです。自分の\n\u3000ことを信じて大切にしてくれる人と一緒だったから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But even so, the princess wasn't truly lonely. She was with someone who believed in her and treasured her.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（幸せの形って、人それぞれなんだなあ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I guess happiness comes in all different forms.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（わたしの幸せは、みんながいる大切な場所で\n\u3000いつまでも楽しく暮らしていけること……かな？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(As for my happiness, I wonder if it is being able to live cheerfully forever alongside everyone...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも、いつか大切な人を一人見つけたら、\n\u3000二人だけでもいいやって思えるのかなあ？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even if I ever found that one special person, would just the two of us would be enough?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（うーん……難しくて分からないや）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Hmm... that's a difficult question.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何か考えごとですか、姫",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Deep in thought about something, Princess?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう。お姫様の役は終わったんですよ――あっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on. The princess roleplay is well and truly over now—Oh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわーん！\u3000もうお休みが終わりだよー！\n早くランターナに帰らなきゃ～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wahhh! My vacation's over! I need to get back to Lantarna right away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノ、ノーヴァ神聖国行きの船、どこかな！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-where's the ship to Nova?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら！\u3000ドレス姿で走るんじゃない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! You can't run around in a dress like that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だって無断欠勤になっちゃいますよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I'll be absent without leave!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいから待て！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just hold on a minute!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ステルク",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sterk"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ。さっきまで物語の中の姫と騎士だったのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honestly. Just a moment ago they were the princess and knight from the story."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもやっぱり、あれがあの二人らしいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But this is definitely more like those two."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。それもそうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. I suppose you're right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]